('augment_boarding_party_ability','Augment Boarding Party','Space','Tactical','Drain Shields and Capture Starship','A boarding party of genetically modified [[Augment]]s beams aboard an enemy vessel, disabling its shields and attempting to seize it. If the ship would be destroyed, instead it warps out, becoming available to the Captain as an Admiralty Card. Up to one such card per eligible ship class may be held''&quot;`UNIQ--ref-00000002-QINU`&quot;'' at a time, and the Cards are consumed on use. Eligible classes are [[:Category:Frigates (npc)|Frigate]], [[:Category:Cruisers (npc)|Cruiser]], [[:Category:Battleships (npc)|Battleship]], and [[:Category:Dreadnoughts (npc)|Dreadnought]]. The use of Augments in modern days is rare but extant. Prohibited by almost all space-faring races after past attempts, small populations of Augments persist in holding cells and back alleys across the galaxy. They are all too willing to assist in combat in exchange for certain liberties.','Ensign','Lieutenant','Lt. Commander','Drain Shields and Capture Starship
*1.0X All Shields every 1 sec for 35 secs 
*If target would be destroyed, the Augment boarders sieze the vessel','Drain Shields and Capture Starship
*1.5X All Shields every 1 sec for 35 secs 
*If target would be destroyed, the Augment boarders sieze the vessel','Drain Shields and Capture Starship
*2.0X All Shields every 1 sec for 35 secs 
*If target would be destroyed, the Augment boarders sieze the vessel','Augment Boarding Party (ability)','SETS-Data 2026-09','source_imported','Imported from STOCD/SETS-Data cargo/boff_abilities.json','{"page":"Augment Boarding Party (ability)","source":"STOCD/SETS-Data"}'),
