('auxiliary_power_to_the_inertial_dampers_ability','Auxiliary Power to the Inertial Dampers','Space','Engineering','Large Kinetic Damage Resistance, Movement Buff, Repel and Disable Immunity','Auxiliary Power to the Inertial Dampers (Aux2Damp) redirects auxiliary power to provide significant kinetic damage resistance, movement turn and speed improvement, and immunity to repel and disable effects.

:It is a fast cycling general purpose mobility and defense ability. When combined with [[Evasive Maneuvers (ability)|Evasive Maneuvers]], it is possible to exceed full impulse speeds even during active combat. The immunity to repel and disable effects will nullify the push/pull effects of abilities such as [[Tractor Beam Repulsors (ability)|Tractor Beam Repulsors]] and [[Gravity Well (ability)|Gravity Well]], but it will not directly counter [[Tractor Beam (ability)|Tractor Beam]]s, although the extra speed may still facilitate an escape.','Lieutenant','Lt. Commander','Commander','* +27.5 Physical and Kinetic Damage Resistance for 15 seconds
* +50% Flight Speed for 15 seconds
* +100% Turn Rate for 15 seconds
* Immunity to Disable for 15 seconds
* Immunity to Repel for 15 seconds','* +36.5 Physical and Kinetic Damage Resistance for 15 seconds
* +50% Flight Speed for 15 seconds
* +100% Turn Rate for 15 seconds
