('battle_strategies_ability','Battle Strategies','Ground','Tactical','Self Buff - Bonus Damage, Debuff Removal, and chance to expose attackers','Battle Strategies removes debuffs and applies a short duration buff that improves all damage. Additionally, any enemy that attacks the target will have a chance of getting Exposed. Can be used on yourself or an ally.','Ensign','Lieutenant','Lieutenant Commander','Removes all debuffs on use&lt;br&gt;+__% Bonus All Damage for 15 sec&lt;br&gt;For 15 secs, when receiving All Damage, 5% chance of applying 8 sec Expose to damage owner','Removes all debuffs on use&lt;br&gt;+__% Bonus All Damage for 15 sec&lt;br&gt;For 15 secs, when receiving All Damage, 5% chance of applying 8 sec Expose to damage owner','Removes all debuffs on use&lt;br&gt;+__% Bonus All Damage for 15 sec&lt;br&gt;For 15 secs, when receiving All Damage, 5% chance of applying 8 sec Expose to damage owner','Battle Strategies (ability)','SETS-Data 2026-09','source_imported','Imported from STOCD/SETS-Data cargo/boff_abilities.json','{"page":"Battle Strategies (ability)","source":"STOCD/SETS-Data"}'),
('beams_fire_at_will_ability','Beams: Fire at Will','Space','Tactical','Attack Upgrade - Multi-Target Rate of Fire','Beams: Fire at Will (FaW) improves your beam weapons, allowing them to fire at multiple targets of their choice, for a short duration. This ability applies to both [[Beam Array]]s and [[Dual Beam Bank]]s. A standard beam attack cycle is four attacks against a single target. After activation, ''''all'''' beam weapons will attack the selected target (if within its arc, otherwise a random target) and a second random target within their firing arc and attack them five times each (for a total of 10 beam attacks per cycle). The effect will apply to any firing cycle that begins during the ability''s duration. If only one target is present, only five attacks are performed. This ability is effective in delivering sustained fire against a few ships or for taking out fighter swarms and targetable projectiles.','Ensign','Lieutenant','Lt. Commander','Upgrades your beam weapons for 10 seconds:
* Firing cycle fires five attacks ''''(up from four)''''
* Attacks hit two random targets per pulse
* Attacks deal 80% of their normal damage
* Attacks have 50 less Accuracy Rating','Upgrades your beam weapons for 10 seconds:
* Firing cycle fires five attacks ''''(up from four)''''
* Attacks hit two random targets per pulse
* Attacks deal 85% of their normal damage
* Attacks have 40 less Accuracy Rating','Upgrades your Beam weapons for 10 seconds:
* Firing cycle fires five attacks ''''(up from four)''''
* Attacks hit two random targets per pulse
* Attacks deal 90% of their normal damage
* Attacks have 30 less Accuracy Rating','Beams: Fire at Will (ability)','SETS-Data 2026-09','source_imported','Imported from STOCD/SETS-Data cargo/boff_abilities.json','{"page":"Beams: Fire at Will (ability)","source":"STOCD/SETS-Data"}'),
('beams_overload_ability','Beams: Overload','Space','Tactical','Attack Upgrade - Damage','Beams: Overload (BO) improves your beam weapons by massively increasing their damage, for a short duration, at the cost of slower shots for the duration. This ability applies to both [[Beam Array]]s and [[Dual Beam Bank]]s. When activated, it can be used to quickly lower a shield facing, or to inflict significant burst damage to an exposed hull.  
:The ability''s damage is a set multiple of the underlying weapon damage, with higher ranks providing a larger damage multiplier. Increasing your training in weapons skills will improve the underlying weapon damage, resulting in an increase in the damage of BO. With higher ranks of this ability, the proper tactical consoles, and significant weapons training, it is possible to inflict devastating amounts of damage to an exposed hull on a critical hit.  
:Having one BO buff active will prevent you from activating any other copies of BO. Consuming a BO buff to fire a BO will trigger a 5 second cooldown period during which no other BO powers can be activated. This 5 second cooldown period is not triggered if the buff just wears off due to duration/unuse, or if the buff is purged by a dispel effect.','Ensign','Lieutenant','Lt. Commander','Overloads your Beam Weapons for 10 sec:
* Beam Damage increased to 3x of default 
* Decreases the fire rate to half of normal
* -5 Weapon power to self while this weapon is firing','Overloads your Beam Weapons for 10 sec:
* Beam Damage increased to 3.5x of default 
* Decreases the fire rate to half of normal
* -5 Weapon power to self while this weapon is firing','Overloads your Beam Weapons for 10 sec:
* Beam Damage increased to 4x of default 
* Decreases the fire rate to half of normal
* -5 Weapon power to self while this weapon is firing','Beams: Overload (ability)','SETS-Data 2026-09','source_imported','Imported from STOCD/SETS-Data cargo/boff_abilities.json','{"page":"Beams: Overload (ability)","source":"STOCD/SETS-Data"}'),
