('explosive_drone_fabrication_ability','Explosive Drone Fabrication','Ground','Engineering','Create Explosive Drone','Explosive Drone Fabrication creates a semi-autonomous drone which identifies and hunts down hostile targets. The drone is equipped with an antiproton beam and a cabrodine-infernite charge. The charge explodes upon reaching close proximity to the enemy target, causing kinetic damage to all nearby enemies. Additionally, this device will self-destruct in twenty seconds.','Lieutenant','Lieutenant Commander','Commander','Summons a level ''''player level + 1'''' Explosive Drone&lt;br&gt;Explosive Drone chases and shoots its target, dealing __ Antiproton Damage every .5 sec&lt;br&gt;Once within 3 meters of target, the drone explodes causing __ Kinetic Damage (50% Shield Penetration) within 4.5m&lt;br&gt;Explosive Drone detonates after 20 sec','Summons a level ''''player level + 1'''' Explosive Drone&lt;br&gt;Explosive Drone chases and shoots its target, dealing __ Antiproton Damage every .5 sec&lt;br&gt;Once within 3 meters of target, the drone explodes causing __ Kinetic Damage (50% Shield Penetration) within 4.5m&lt;br&gt;Explosive Drone detonates after 20 sec','Summons a level ''''player level + 1'''' Explosive Drone&lt;br&gt;Explosive Drone chases and shoots its target, dealing __ Antiproton Damage every .5 sec&lt;br&gt;Once within 3 meters of target, the drone explodes causing __ Kinetic Damage (50% Shield Penetration) within 4.5m&lt;br&gt;Explosive Drone detonates after 20 sec','Explosive Drone Fabrication (ability)','SETS-Data 2026-09','source_imported','Imported from STOCD/SETS-Data cargo/boff_abilities.json','{"page":"Explosive Drone Fabrication (ability)","source":"STOCD/SETS-Data"}'),
('extend_shields_ability','Extend Shields','Space','Engineering','Target Friend Small Shield Regen and Large Shield Damage Resistance','Extend Shields (ES) regenerates the shields of the target ally and improves their shield damage resistance. Increases in effectiveness based on current shield power level.
:*''''Usage notes'''': Be aware that the ability has a 10 km range. This means that if you apply it to an ally, and then they go beyond 10 Km, they stop benefiting from the heal. However, targets can sail back into the 10 Km sphere and regain the heal. Hence, it is important to corral your team-mates (in-game chat/voice, or 3rd party applications), as well as being mindful of your proximity to your team-mates too.
:**This is NOT an ability that you can apply to yourself. Therefore, if you &lt;u&gt;only&lt;/u&gt; play solo content (such as story content and patrols), then this ability should be avoided.
:**ES is a channeled ability, so the 15 second cooldown on the ability does not start until the ability ends. Once the ability is activated, it cannot be manually cancelled early by the player, nor can the target of the ability be changed.','Lieutenant','Lt. Commander','Commander','To target non-self ally for 30 sec:
