('temporal_anomaly_containment_ability','Temporal Anomaly Containment','Ground','Science','Deploys Turret that Taunts and Tractors Foes','Deploy a Turret that tractors targeted Foe toward itself and Taunts it. If the Foe dies during the effect, the Turret will select a new target on its own. Does not work against Player Captains.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A recreation of strange tether devices found on Essof IV, this technology is believed to have been intended to capture the Red Angel. While it is not known whether this was successful, the technology is certainly effective.','Lieutenant','Lieutenant Commander','Commander','Creates a Temporal Anomaly Containment device for 60 sec&lt;br&gt;To targeted Foe while device operates:
