('timeline_collapse_ability','Timeline Collapse','Space','Temporal Operative','The ''''''Timeline Collapse'''''' ability creates an ''''anomaly'''' at the target''s location which reveals [[cloak]]ed ships, disables [[Pilot Maneuvers (ability)|Pilot Maneuvers]], pulls all foes within 3km area to center and deals [[AoE]] Physical [[Hazard]] damage. All effects are enhanced by Entropy points on Foes (which are then consumed), while Damage received is decreased with distance from center.','Initiate a violent rupture into an alternate timeline, causing a turbulent instability of local spacetime. Enemies caught in the resulting anomaly will be pulled towards its center for a few seconds before it collapses. Upon collapsing, the resulting explosion will deal physical damage (more damage closer to the epicenter) as well as briefly disabling affected foes. The damage and disable are amplifies by the presence of Entropy on affected foes.','Lt. Commander','Commander','Commander','Creates a level 61 Timeline Collapse for 5 sec:
