('torpedo_transport_warhead_ability','Torpedo: Transport Warhead','Space','Intelligence','Torpedo Upgrade - Firing Arc Buff, Shield Bypass, Subsystem Offline','The next torpedo launched by your vessel loses its firing arc requirements, and will be transported instantly to the command decks of the enemy ship. After a short fuse timer it will explode to deal damage which bypasses shields. This explosion also has a chance to knock a random subsystem offline.','Lieutenant Commander','Commander','Commander','Next torpedo gains:
