('torpedoes_high_yield_ability','Torpedoes: High Yield','Space','Tactical','Attack Upgrade - Damage','Torpedoes: High Yield (T:HY, HYT) upgrades the next [[Torpedo Launcher|torpedo]] attack to fire a salvo of torpedoes at a single target.  Each rank will fire one additional torpedo in the salvo (Rank 1 fires two torpedoes, Rank 2 fires three, and Rank 3 fires four).  Some torpedoes (all [[Tricobalt Torpedo Launcher|Tricobalt-based]], some Reputation/Lobi, and all [[Plasma Torpedo Launcher|Plasma Torpedos]]) will fire a single, highly destructive, ''heavy'' torpedo.  With the exception of the Enhanced Bio-Molecular Photon Torpedo, all ''heavy'' torpedoes (denoted as ''heavies'') move significantly slower than normal torpedoes, and can be [[Destructible torpedo|destroyed]] in mid-flight.

:In most cases, torpedoes that have a percent chance to generate a secondary effect will have a 100% chance to generate said secondary effect under this firing mode (e.g. [[Gravimetric Photon Torpedo Launcher|Gravimetric Photon Torpedo]]).

